@startuml
title Test Pipeline (Profiles)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName "Arial"
top to bottom direction

rectangle "docker compose up -d\nfake-serial + qr-c" as Up
rectangle "Healthchecks\n(fake-serial: nc)\n(qr-c: GET /health)" as HC
rectangle "api-test (pytest)\nblack-box assertions" as APIT
rectangle "contract-test (schemathesis)\nOpenAPI contract\n(exclude unsupported_method)" as CT
rectangle "Result: exit code 0" as OK

Up --> HC
HC --> APIT : profile=test
HC --> CT : profile=test
APIT --> OK
CT --> OK

note right of CT
Schemathesis runs:
- INIT pre-step
- checks all
- excludes: unsupported_method
end note

@enduml
